  orthogonal box = (-18.350036 -24.206188 -9.1556953) to (16.531016 13.97878 20.528354)
  4 by 5 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  4020 bonds
  reading angles ...
  7100 angles
  reading dihedrals ...
  11170 dihedrals
  reading impropers ...
